sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor F as Finance staff
    actor S as Student
    participant FI as finance-service
    participant AD as admission-service
    participant K as Kafka
    participant RP as reporting-service
    participant NO as notification-service

    K->>FI: student-admitted
    FI->>AD: student profile (Feign)
    FI->>FI: plan = course fee - discount, split into instalments with due dates
    FI->>K: fee-plan-created

    Note over FI: When a student is placed in a batch
    K->>FI: enrollment-created (student name and code, course, batch)
    FI->>FI: no live plan yet: raise the course fee as one installment due in 7 days (flagged auto-created)
    FI->>K: fee-plan-created

    Note over F,FI: Extra charges
    F->>FI: POST /api/fee-plans/{id}/charges, or /charges/batch (title, amount, pay-by date)
    FI->>FI: a named installment, the total grows, a settled plan is active again
    FI->>K: notify each student (New fee, pay it online from Fees)

    F->>FI: record payment (amount, mode, reference)
    FI->>FI: refuse if the amount is more than the outstanding
    FI->>FI: apply to instalments oldest first (state is worked out each time: PAID, PARTLY_PAID, DUE, OVERDUE, UPCOMING)
    FI->>FI: receipt number
    FI->>K: payment-recorded
    K->>RP: income and collection facts
    FI->>FI: draw the receipt as a PDF: logo and name, boxed details (receipt no, student, phone, course, batch and time, due amount), a particulars table of the fee heads paid, total in words, mode and reference, tax information (GST break-up or no GST), paid and balance percent, signature lines
    FI->>K: payment-receipt-email (the PDF travels in the event)
    K->>NO: queue an email to the student with the PDF attached
    alt outstanding becomes 0
        FI->>FI: plan ACTIVE -> SETTLED
    end

    opt Mistake
        F->>FI: reverse payment (reason)
        FI->>FI: reversed payments no longer count
        FI->>K: audit.recorded
    end

    Note over FI: InstallmentReminderJob runs on a schedule
    FI->>FI: find instalments past due and unpaid
    FI->>K: installment-overdue
    K->>RP: overdue counts for the finance desk
    S->>FI: view my fees and receipts
    opt pay online from Fees
        S->>FI: POST /api/payments/online/fee-orders (own plan, amount at most the outstanding)
        FI-->>S: Razorpay order
        S->>FI: POST /api/payments/online/verify (signature checked)
        FI->>FI: record an ONLINE payment on the plan, as for a counter payment
    end
    FI->>FI: outstanding = net fee - successful payments, computed on every read
    FI-->>S: instalments, receipts, outstanding
    S->>FI: GET /api/payments/{id}/receipt/pdf (own payments only)
    FI-->>S: the same PDF that was emailed, figures as of today
